# Sicarian Infiltrator ({2}{U}, 1/2; printed Oracle: "Flash / Squad {2} / Benediction of the Omnissiah - When this
# creature enters, draw a card.") cast with flash on Bot2's upkeep (turn 2), squad paid twice (CR 702.157a): seven
# mana from Black Lotus, Sol Ring, Mox Sapphire and an Island. It enters with two linked triggers: squad makes two
# token copies (CR 707.2), and its Benediction draws a card. Each token is a copy, so it has Benediction too and draws
